OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to reapply for a
OL,4,Ablue badge?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amputee was shocked and
OL,7,F"disheartened" to discover he needed
OL,8,Fmore than photographic evidence of his
OL,9,Fmissing leg to renew his blue badge.
OL,11,FAfter Nigel Ward, 71, from King's Lynn,
OL,12,Fwent public with the story, Lindsey
OL,13,FChant, from Northampton, and Julie,
OL,14,Ffrom Southend-on-Sea, Essex, used Your
OL,15,FVoice to get in touch with the BBC
OL,16,Fabout similar struggles.
OL,18,FBlue badges are disabled parking cards
OL,19,Fissued by local authorities to help
OL,20,Fpeople with mobility issues park closer
OL,21,Fto the goods and services they need to
OL,22,Fuse.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
