OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to reapply for a
OL,4,Ablue badge?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo why are people, some of whose
OL,7,Fconditions have worsened over time,
OL,8,Fstruggling to reapply for their blue
OL,9,Fbadges - and who is eligible?
